 ade Christmas cookies\, and Christmas cheer!\n\nBrowse a wonderful variety
  of unique handmade creations\, crafts\, gifts\, and merchandise offered b
 y local community vendors. It’s a great opportunity to discover one-of-a
 -kind treasures\, find special Christmas gifts\, and support talented loca
 l crafters and small businesses.\n\nBe sure to stop by the cookie cottage
 \, where church volunteers have baked dozens upon dozens of delicious Chri
 stmas cookies just in time for the holiday season! Whether you’re fillin
 g a cookie tray\, preparing treats for family and friends\, or simply look
 ing for something sweet\, there will be plenty of holiday goodies to enjoy
 . Lunch will also be available for purchase\, so come hungry and make a mo
 rning of it!\n\nMost importantly\, this special annual event supports East
 side Assembly of God’s mortgage fundraiser\, helping our church continue
  its ministry and mission in the community.\n\nBring your family and frien
 ds and enjoy a festive morning of shopping\, homemade treats\, good food\,
  and Christmas fellowship. We look forward to celebrating the season with 
 you!
