 rmer with a B.A. in Musical Performance and Theatre. Before she was shapin
 g the next generation of musicians\, she was a professional singer\, dance
 r\, and actress gracing stages at Cedar Point\, Nashville Follies\, and
  Coach light Musicals. Whether she’s fronting the 17-piece Stonehenge 
 Big Band or swinging with Abbey and the Dancin’ Shoes\, Kari brings a 
 theatrical spark that is truly "fabulous."·        The Sax: Chip 
 McNeill A true titan of the industry\, Chip found out he won a Grammy Aw
 ard while teaching at Virginia Tech. He’s toured the world several time
 s over with jazz royalty\, including the Woody Herman Young Thundering He
 rd\, Maynard Ferguson\, Arturo Sandoval\, and Doc Severinsen.·    
     The Keys: "Doc" John Spicknall A Peabody Conservatory alum and a 
 fixture of the Indiana music scene since 1969\, Doc spent 40 years as the 
 co-principal clarinet for the Terre Haute Symphony. He brings a lifetime 
 of academic prestige and effortless jazz phrasing to the piano.·    
     The Bass &amp\; Host: Todd Gallagher A recently retired nurse tur
 ned freelance bassist\, Todd is the heartbeat of the show. When he isn’t
  mentoring young bassists or performing in community orchestras and jazz g
 roups across the region\, Todd is embracing his "retirement" by traveling 
 and practicing his craft. He brings the groove\, the grit\, and the local 
 charm that makes this show a one-of-a-kind experience. ✨ Plus: Surprise 
 Cameos &amp\; Special Guests! ✨This isn't just a concert—it’s a true
  holiday celebration. Keep your eyes on the wings for surprise appearances
  from some of Martinsville’s favorite people and beloved characters. You
  never know who might stop by the MET to join in the holiday fun!﻿
GEO:39.428027;-86.4280804
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre (The MET)\, 36 East Morgan Str
 eet\, Martinsville\, 46151
URL:https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/todd-gallaghers-fabulous-jazz-ch
 ristmas-show
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
