 1-43f9-9ac9-7cae6907bc84.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Step inside the historic Gothic Chapel for a very special scre
 ening of Resting Place\, a documentary short by Crown Hill Foundation Arti
 sts in Residence Jessica Dunn and Michael Moskaliuk. Blending time-lapse c
 inematography\, animation\, and original music\, Resting Place reveals the
  beauty\, history\, and ever-changing landscape of one of Indianapolis's m
 ost remarkable landmarks.The evening begins with the feature screening\, f
 ollowed by a live audience Q&amp\;A with the filmmakers\, offering a behin
 d-the-scenes look at the inspiration\, creative process\, and stories behi
 nd the film. Whether you're drawn to art\, film\, history\, or the quiet b
 eauty of Crown Hill\, this one-night premiere offers a rare opportunity to
  experience Crown Hill Cemetery through an entirely new lens.Tickets are $
 10. Speaker Series is held in our Gothic Chapel\, reached through our 34th
  Street Gothic Gate entrance at 3402 Blvd. Place\, Indpls\, 46074.
